@startuml C4-Dynamic-SSOLogin
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — SSO login (OIDC Authorization Code)

actor "End User" as user
participant "Business App\nRelying Party" as app <<ui>>
participant "IAM Application\nOIDC Provider :9100" as iam <<java>>
participant "External IdP\nGoogle / GitHub" as idp <<external>>
database "Metadata DB" as db <<db>>

user -> app: 1. Access protected resource
app --> user: 2. Start /oauth2/authorize\n(web redirect or ASWebAuthenticationSession)
user -> iam: 3. GET /oauth2/authorize\n(client_id, redirect_uri, scope, state, PKCE)
iam -> db: 4. Load RegisteredClient
db --> iam: 5. Client settings
alt No full MFA session
  iam --> user: 6. Redirect /login?client_id=…
  user -> iam: 7. Form login → FACTOR_PASSWORD
  alt Second factor (anyOf)
    user -> iam: 8a. OTT generate + submit → FACTOR_OTT
  else Passkey enrolled
    user -> iam: 8b. WebAuthn assertion → FACTOR_WEBAUTHN
  else TOTP enrolled
    user -> iam: 8c. TOTP code → FACTOR_TOTP
  end
  opt External IdP (federation)
    iam --> user: 9. Redirect to IdP
    user -> idp: 10. Authenticate
    idp --> iam: 11. OAuth2 callback
    iam -> db: 12. Upsert FederatedIdentity + User
  end
end
iam --> user: 13. Consent (if required) + redirect with code
user -> app: 14. redirect_uri?code=…&state=…
alt Confidential client
  app -> iam: 15a. POST /oauth2/token\n(client_id, client_secret, code)
else Public native client (PKCE)
  app -> iam: 15b. POST /oauth2/token\n(client_id, code, code_verifier)\nno client_secret
end
iam --> app: 16. Access Token (+ ID / Refresh)\nemail/profile claims on access token when scoped
app -> iam: 17. JWKS verify / userinfo (optional)
app --> user: 18. Application session / Bearer API calls

note right of iam
  MFA: PASSWORD + anyOf(OTT, WEBAUTHN, TOTP)
  Demo: demo / demo-password
  Discovery: /.well-known/openid-configuration
  Native seeds: explore-ai-ios, explore-chat-ios
  Custom-scheme redirects allowed (RFC 8252)
end note

@enduml
